WEBVTT

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.480
They'll spend a billion on a missile in a day.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.920
They'll spend a billion on a missile in a day.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.180
But ask for forest research

00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:45.650
watch the money walk away

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:55.900
The mycel feeds the roots that feed the grain that feeds us all

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:04.200
The mycel feeds the roots that feed the grain that feeds us all

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:13.090
But nobody funds the ground

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:19.700
until the harvest starts to fall.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:30.520
A healthy soil can feed a nation clean the water hold the rain.

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:38.650
A healthy soil can feed a nation, clean the water, hold the rain

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.400
But science begs for crumbs

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:53.260
while tanks roll down the lane

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:04.150
They say the budget's tight

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.200
they say we have to choose

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:12.010
They say the budget's tight

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:16.010
they say we have to choose

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:20.480
But you can't eat a weapon when the

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:26.470
topsoil's blown its fuse

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.920
Who speaks for the forest

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.020
Nobody in the hall

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:35.780
Who speaks for the mycel

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:38.630
Nobody at all

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.630
Who's gonna feed us when the last good soil is gone

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.700
Lord, we've been singing this too long

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:24.340
The oldest network on this earth asks nothing but a chance

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:32.770
The oldest network on this earth asks nothing but a chance

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.960
We're running out of time

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:46.690
to learn its language and its dance
